# SoC 移植

## 目录结构创建

在Zephyr仓库中创建BK7258 SoC支持：

```
zephyr/soc/arm/arm/becon_bk7258/
├── CMakeLists.txt
├── Kconfig
├── soc.h
├── linkers/
│   └── linker.ld
└── src/
    ├── soc.c
    ├── soc_config.h
    └── startup.c
```

## 1. Kconfig配置

创建 `Kconfig`：

```kconfig
# Copyright (c) 2026 BK7258 Zephyr Port Contributors
# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

config SOC_ARM_ARM_BEKEN_BK7258
    bool
    select ARM
    select CPU_CORTEX_M33
    select CPU_CORTEX_M_HAS_SYSTICK
    select CPU_HAS_FPU
    select ARMV8_M_DSP
    select ARMV8_M_SAUL
    select SOC_FAMILY_ARM_BEKEN

config SOC
    string
    default "beken_bk7258"

config SOC_SERIES
    string
    default "beken-bk7258"

config SYS_CLOCK_HW_CYCLES_PER_SEC
    int
    default 120000000

config KERNEL_LOAD_PIN
    int
    default 0

config NUM_IRQS
    int
    default 64  # 根据实际中断数量调整
```

## 2. 链接脚本

创建 `linkers/linker.ld`：

```ld
/*
 * Copyright (c) 2026 BK7258 Zephyr Port Contributors
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 */

#include <zephyr/arch/arm/cortex_m/scripts/linker.ld>
#include <zephyr/linker/linker-tool.h>

/* 内存区域定义 - 基于BK7258硬件手册 */
MEMORY
{
    /* Flash: 4MB (起始地址需根据硬件手册确认) */
    FLASH (rx) : ORIGIN = 0x0, LENGTH = 4M

    /* SRAM: 256KB @ 0x22000000 */
    SRAM (rwx) : ORIGIN = 0x22000000, LENGTH = 256K

    /* PSRAM (可选) */
    PSRAM (rwx) : ORIGIN = 0x60000000, LENGTH = 8M
}

SECTION_PROLOGUE(.stext,,)
{
    __text_start = .;
    KEEP(*(.stext*))
} GROUP_FLASH_LINKER INTO FLASH

SECTIONS
{
    /* BK7258特定section */
    .beken ALIGN(4) : {
        KEEP(*(.beken*))
    } > SRAM
}

#include <zephyr/linker/ram-sections.ld>
#include <zephyr/linker/common-rom.ld>
```

